    "chunk_text": "ende fram dea\u00f0e gecigde. \u00d0\u00e6t he his preosta \u00e6nne of horse fallende & gebrysedne gelice gebiddende & bletsigende fram \u00d0\u00e6t Ceadwala Westseaxna cyning to gefulliane com to Rome: swa eft his \u00e6fterfyligend Ine \u00f0a \u00d0\u00e6t, for\u00f0ferdum \u00deeodoro, \u00f0one arcebiscophad Beorhtwald onfeng; &, betweox o\u00f0ra monige \u00fee he \u00d0\u00e6t se halga wer Ecbyrht becuman wolde on Germaniam to bodianne godcunde lare. Ac he ne mihte: ac Wihtbyrht \u00f0yder becom for him, & \u00f0\u00e6r nowiht ne fremede; & \u00fea eft w\u00e6s ham \u00d0\u00e6t Wilbrord on Frysena lande bodiende monega to Drihtne gecyrde : & \u00fe\u00e6t his geferan twegen \u00d0\u00e6t se arwur\u00f0a wer Swi\u00f0byrht on Breotone, & Wilbrord \u00e6t Rome biscopas w\u00e6ron Fresna \u00f0eode \u00d0\u00e6t sum on Nor\u00f0anhymbra m\u00e6g\u00f0e of dea\u00f0e arisende sume swi\u00f0e ondryslicu & eac to \u00d0\u00e6t ongean \u00feam o\u00f0er, to dea\u00f0e becumende, geseah him fram deoflum tobrohte beon \u00f0a boc his \u00d0\u00e6t eft o\u00f0er sweltende him \u00fea getealdan stowe mid helwarum his agenra wita geseah. \u00d0\u00e6t monega cyricean on Hibernia l\u00e6rendum Athamano \u00fea eallgeleaflican Eastran onfengon: & be \u00d0\u00e6tte Cynred Mercna cyning & Offa Eastseaxna cyning on munuclicum hadum to Rome becom, \u00d0\u00e6t \u00feam eauf\u00e6stan abbude Adriano Albinus \u00e6fterfyligde: & fram \u00feam biscope Wil",
